{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:301","content":{"id":301,"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","content":[{"type":"project-card-list","items":[{"id":302,"title":"以我为主","summary":"一会儿积累这方面的知识，一会儿积累那方面的知识，墙头草，不知道自己的方向。一个原则：以我为主，增援未来的自己，未来的自己会怎么用，未来想成为什么样的人，以终为始","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},{"id":303,"title":"持续不断","summary":"持续记录的重要性，知识需要时间的累积才能看到效果，不可能一口气吃成一个大胖子。换了很多的笔记软件，尝试了很多的笔记方法，都没有办法坚持不断的进行记录，原因在于没","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:303","type":"doc","id":303}}],"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何积累知识，两个原则："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以我为主"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持续不断"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}}],"prevPage":{"title":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}},"nextPage":{"title":"以我为主","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},"createTime":1743911853351,"updateTime":1743915868665,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743915868665}}